    On air 24/7, with programs updated monthly.'
  - Schedule & latest updates on X
  - Things to do
  - 'Here are a few ways to spend your time. Try them in any order you like.


    Pet
    a dog. Throw a ball. Offer a treat. That alone is plenty.


    From Call in
    your personal menu, you can call a dog to a place you like and have it sleep
    beside you. I explain more in Calling dogs.


    Memorable moments become photos
    on the board by the veranda. I talk about those in Photos.


    Dress lets you
    dress up a dog, and Particles lets you change the petting glow. When someone
    hosts a show from Live, everyone here can watch together. Play has the dog-eye
    camera and Trainer play. I explain the requirements for Live and Trainer, along
    with shopping, in Shopping.


    On the board beside me, you can give the dogs
    names and choose a favorite.


    You need not try everything. Just watching
    is fine, too.'
