  - 'Nothing in hand? The usual play is all here

    - Pet: stroke the head, cheeks
    or chin and the dog answers

    - Throw a ball: pick one up and throw it, and
    the dog brings it back

    - Nap together: from Call on this board a dog comes
    and sleeps beside you

    - Photos: good moments are captured automatically
    and shown on the veranda board


    What this board does: time spent here becomes
    points to trade for things you like

    - Treats, Dress, Live: bring out, put
    on a dog, open in the garden (everyone here watches a live together). From the
    tabs above

    - Points and Grandpa: Points at the top right shows how to earn
    and gift codes. Grandpa in the garden teaches how to play and gives your first
    points'
