  - Use of generative AI
  - 'As a software engineer, I use AI in my day-to-day development work.


    I
    also use generative AI as one of the tools for developing this world. I use it
    for tasks such as writing and revising code, modeling, and translation, while
    working through design, implementation, refinement, and testing.


    Some 3D
    models were created using 3D generation services.


    The music for ParticleLive
    uses generative AI services such as Suno.


    The creator makes the decisions
    about which work to use and publish, and takes responsibility for those decisions.


    I
    see AI as one of my creative tools, and hope to use it to enrich the experience
    of playing with animals.'
