  - About VAnimal
  - "About VAnimal\n\nVAnimal creates VRChat worlds about spending time and playing
    with animals. In Japanese, we also go by \u201CVanimaru\u201D (\u3070\u306B\u307E\u308B).\n\nA
    dog looks happy when you pet it.\nBrings back the ball you throw.\nFalls asleep
    at your feet.\n\nWe made Kominka Dog Run because we wanted to enjoy those moments
    of playing and spending time with dogs together in VRChat.\n\nIn the future,
    we would like to make worlds where you can spend time with dogs in open outdoor
    spaces, wash and play with animals, or enjoy caring for them in a place like
    an animal hospital.\n\nBeyond creating worlds, we would also like to hold events
    such as tours of animal-themed worlds.\n\nWe hope to gradually add more places
    and ways to spend time together, enjoying all the different ways animals respond
    to us.\n\nWe share our latest news on Discord.\nYou can join through the link
    on VAnimal\u2019s VRChat group page."
  - About VAnimal Trainer
  - 'About VAnimal Trainer


    VAnimal Trainer is a time-limited membership for
    people who want to play more with the dogs.


    As a Trainer, you can gather
    the dogs, have them race, or choose two dogs to play together.


    Take a group
    photo with everyone, or watch a race.

    Everyone there can enjoy the activities
    a Trainer starts.


    Pet a dog, throw a ball, or have a dog sleep beside you.

    These
    everyday ways to play remain available to everyone.


    Accessories, toys,
    and live performances are sold separately and are not included in Trainer membership.


    We
    would also like to offer Trainers ways to play with dogs suited to each of the
    worlds we create in the future. The activities and their release dates have not
    yet been decided.


    Choose from four membership periods:

    1 month: 500
    Credits

    3 months: 1,350 Credits (450 Credits per month)

    6 months: 2,550
    Credits (425 Credits per month)

    12 months: 4,800 Credits (400 Credits per
    month)


    Membership does not renew automatically.'
  - '?'
  - How photos work
  - 'Photos are taken automatically when a dog brings back a ball, while you pet
    a dog, and during races or play between dogs. In the bedroom, they also capture
    you relaxing together.


    Photos are taken at intervals, rather than continuously.
    New photos replace the oldest ones in each category.


    This album is just
    for you. Other people see different photos on their boards.


    Photos disappear
    when you leave. To keep one on PC or Quest, bring your VRChat camera close to
    it and take a picture. On a phone, tap the photo and take a screenshot.


    You
    can turn automatic photography OFF using Resolution settings beside the photo
    board.'
