  - '2K quality applies to photos taken after switching. Existing photos gain no
    new detail.

    Photos are kept when you change quality. Detail lost by switching
    to Standard cannot be restored by switching back to 2K.

    OFF stops new photos.
    You can still view and take home existing photos.

    Only your photos are affected.
    This preference is saved for your next visit.'
