  - Choose a shape, check the ground markers, then gather. Slots without a marker
    cannot be used there. Slopes are fine. After a minute the dogs roam free from
    where they are
  - Gather in 6 formations
  - 'As a Trainer you can gather the dogs for a group photo. Perks bought at the
    farmhouse work here too.

    500 Credits for 1 month / 1,350 for 3 / 2,550 for
    6 / 4,800 for 12. No auto-renewal; an extension adds to the remaining days.'
